            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursor Slayer is a semi-idle game where your mouse cursor is a spinning blade. Move it across the board to cut down waves of monsters. The more you play, the more powerful you become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 20+ artifacts across themed sets (fire, ice, wealth, dark, time, nature). Combining the right pieces unlocks powerful set bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across Classic, Sand, Ice, Ruins, Lava, and Void environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests for rewards and track your kills in the Bestiary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, spend Astral Essence in the Ascension to permanently:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade a growing arsenal of magic: rain fire with Fireball, chain-zap crowds with Lightning, freeze a horde solid with Frost Nova, melt through armor with Poison, shatter the ground with Earth Shatter, or pull enemies into a deadly Gravity Well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade nodes that gives: damage, more time in each run, rage meter, more time in &quot;auto&quot; mode and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursor Slayer is a semi-idle game where your mouse cursor is a spinning blade. Move it across the board to cut down waves of monsters. The more you play, the more powerful you become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 20+ artifacts across themed sets (fire, ice, wealth, dark, time, nature). Combining the right pieces unlocks powerful set bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across Classic, Sand, Ice, Ruins, Lava, and Void environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests for rewards and track your kills in the Bestiary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, spend Astral Essence in the Ascension to permanently:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade a growing arsenal of magic: rain fire with Fireball, chain-zap crowds with Lightning, freeze a horde solid with Frost Nova, melt through armor with Poison, shatter the ground with Earth Shatter, or pull enemies into a deadly Gravity Well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade nodes that gives: damage, more time in each run, rage meter, more time in &quot;auto&quot; mode and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
